Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 4 – Ultimate Battle: The Next Generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:16.94,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fax-0.55}A Mysterious Rock Appears
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:16.94,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fax-0.8}Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.37\pos(932,738)}End
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When Big Humphrey told us the news, I was so startled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Green Green Grassland will become a high-tech city after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to miss the Green Green Grassland we have now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be sad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re making a time capsule to commemorate it, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep digging!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to help out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, the hole is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up will be…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The time capsule is ready, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m putting a dumbbell inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m putting in a letter to my future self.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll just put a few snacks in there, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, those few snacks won’t fit in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I’ll just eat them now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brothers and sisters…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to put a picture book into the time capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.88,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, I thought you’d put one of your inventions in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that’s because Wilie drew this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It depicts our past adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.44,0:01:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s something more important than inventions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, I want to go on more adventures with you in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s close the capsule, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s one more thing I want to put in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.52,0:02:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The last one misses out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I that heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn’t your fault, Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.56,0:02:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s so much smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.84,0:02:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was crashed up right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.84,0:02:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What a big crater!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s just keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s something over…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this crater caused by that strange stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If I’m not mistaken…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This…this season, I finally get to be the main character!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder Summon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.12,0:03:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Invent my creation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn’t there any reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, how about we take the stone to Mr. Slowy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Mr. Slowy solves the mystery of the stone, I can become the main character!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for us…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can’t I seem to get any results?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, we’ve made a huge discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We just picked up this strange rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that just now…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not reacting anymore…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I really need to study this properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,After studying it for so long…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know now is that this rock holds immense energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:05:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and that there’s some kind of connection between the rock and the robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.04,0:05:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But our current technology still can’t decipher it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to study it some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.76,0:05:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you all still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The celebration is about to start, yet here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We almost forgot—let’s go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll let the computer continue analyzing, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Today marks the celebration of Green Green Grassland’s
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,transformation into a high-technology city.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Science and technology constitute the primary productive force.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Green Green Grassland is sure to have a bright future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:05:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To mark this fresh start, let’s all take a group photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.60,0:06:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Positions, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s all grab a bite to eat while we wait for the fireworks display.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A technology city, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m really looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What will Green Green Grassland be like in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And what will {\i1}we{\i0} be like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I’ll definitely be taller than Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m happy just being with everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.28,0:06:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to keep guarding Goats’ Village and protect everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I’ll just eat even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You really haven’t changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Weslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As for me, I’m going to…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to have a barbecue, but they forgot to bring the grill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So…let’s go to the lab and get it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, I want to go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good kid; have an tangerine while you wait for Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.92,0:07:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy will be right back after you finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for Daddy, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:45.72,lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Even though I’m just a little goat (wolf)… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the door open already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.64,0:07:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that strange stone yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven’t answered my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.12,0:08:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll catch you, Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of weapon is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It can actually turn things into iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A portal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let him take that stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep hesitating,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,he’s going to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not a very good swimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.54,0:10:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.52,0:10:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Weslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s about to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, let’s fly over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t forget me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.88,0:11:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven’t Weslie and Wolffy come back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m practically starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a real shame Weslie and Wolffy can’t see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
